stem:
Determine whether the following medication scenarios are "prescription drugs" or "over-the-counter (OTC) drugs":
(1) Must be purchased with a prescription from a licensed physician and taken as directed;
(2) It can be purchased without a prescription and taken according to the attached instructions. It is suitable for minor injuries and illnesses.

